    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "A superb opportunity arises to acquire this most attractive bay windowed detached family home. This spacious home enjoys a prominent corner site location in a quiet cul-de-sac off Nutley Lane and is further complemented by a southerly aspect.\r\n\r\nSt Stephen’s Green is approximately 4km to the north and No.1 is also close to many of Dublin’s principal places of business such as the Grand Canal Dock and IFSC. \r\n\r\nTogether with the Merrion Shopping Centre (Anchored by Tesco) the villages of Donnybrook, Ballsbridge and Sandymount are all within walking distance and combine to offer a virtually unrivaled choice of services and amenities. These include leading supermarkets, specialist retailers and numerous eateries, many of which are award winning. The area also benefits from a host of sporting and leisure clubs offering the Gym, Tennis, Rugby, Soccer and GAA fans an excellent choice. \r\n\r\nThe choice of schools and educational facilities includes Star of the Sea National School, Sandymount Park Educate Together, Muckross Park College, Willow Park / Blackrock College, and St Michaels College. The campuses of both University College Dublin (Belfield) and Trinity College (College Green) are also both very accessible.\r\n\r\nWhile all the above are within walking distance, those wishing to travel further afield can avail themselves of the many frequent bus routes or the Dart rail service (Sydney Parade)\r\n\r\nHomes in this cul-de-sac rarely come to market, and strong demand is anticipated due to this enclave’s reputation for offering spacious and cleverly configured family homes, so early viewing is essential to ensure this opportunity does not pass you by."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Passing through the glazed porch leads to the reception hall off which is a guest wc a study overlooking the front garden and rear courtyard. \r\nThe drawing room is the centerpiece of this spacious family home as it spans the width of the house and has two large bay windows overlooking the gardens. A handsome marble surround fireplace provides an excellent focal point. \r\n\r\nThe dining room is accessible from both the drawing room and large kitchen, which has an extensive range of fitted wall and floor level units.\r\n \r\nThe utility room leads to a rear patio and off-street parking. A playroom is suitable for a variety of uses as it has direct access to the fully enclosed rear courtyard.\r\n\r\nOn the first floor the landing is fitted with some excellent storage and has access to the attic. There are five bedrooms two of which are ensuite and all are fitted with built-in wardrobes. The family bathroom has a wc, whb, bidet and a bath with shower attachments."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Rooms",
        "SortOrder": 2,
        "Content": "Porch - \r\nwith glazed doors leads to:\n\r\n\r\nReception Hall - \r\nwith under stair storage and a guest wc.\n\r\n\r\nStudy - \r\ndual aspect overlooking the front garden and rear courtyard.\n\r\n\r\nDrawing Room - \r\nextends the full width house, two bay windows, open fireplace with a marble surround.\n\r\n\r\nDining Room - \r\nwith access from both the drawing room and kitchen.\n\r\n\r\nKitchen - \r\nfitted floor and eye level units, integrated domestic appliances. Patio door to the courtyard.\n\r\n\r\nUtility Room - \r\nwith access to a rear patio and the driveway beyond.\n\r\n\r\nPlayroom - \r\nMulti purpose room with access to the rear courtyard.\r\n\r\nFirst Floor Landing - \r\nwith fitted storage and a hotpress and access to the attic.\n\r\n\r\nBedroom - \r\ndouble room with built in wardrobes and a wash hand basin.\n\r\n\r\nBedroom - \r\ndouble room with built in wardrobes and an ensuite shower room.\n\r\n\r\nBedroom - \r\nspacious single with built in wardrobes.\n\r\n\r\nBedroom - \r\ndouble room with built in wardrobes.\n\r\n\r\nMaster Bedroom - \r\nwith built in wardrobes.\n\r\n\r\nEnsuite Bathroom - \r\nwith a wc, whb, bidet, bath and walk in shower.\n\r\n\r\nFamily Bathroom - \r\nwith a wc, whb, bidet and a bath with shower attachments.\n\r\n\r\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Generously proportioned detached family home in a quiet but convenient cul de sac.\r\nWalking distance to the Merrion Centre, Donnybrook, Ballsbridge together with Sandymount village and Strand.\r\nOff street parking for several cars.\r\nSun drenched courtyard to the rear. \r\nGas fired heating.\r\nExcellent transport services include public bus routes, Dart and the AirCoach.\r\nBER D    Certificate No: 119516326"
      },
      {
